WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.712 --> 00:00:03.295
(somber music)

00:00:05.369 --> 00:00:08.619
- [Voiceover] My mom is amazing person.

00:00:17.587 --> 00:00:19.775
- [Voiceover] Jannet
Castanon and Rosario Vargas

00:00:19.775 --> 00:00:24.557
are a mother and daughter
separated by a border,

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.714
one living in San Diego

00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:28.714
and the other in Mexico.

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:35.297
- I came from Mexico, 2006,

00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:39.297
because I want to get
opportunities for my kids.

00:00:52.489 --> 00:00:54.162
- [Voiceover] I don't have the permission

00:00:54.162 --> 00:00:56.662
to cross the border, the line.

00:00:58.306 --> 00:01:00.368
From the last year and a half,

00:01:00.368 --> 00:01:02.951
I see my mom through the fence.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:08.693
- [Voiceover] At the site
of a bi-national park

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:10.072
in San Diego,

00:01:10.072 --> 00:01:13.244
the U.S. Border Patrol
allows families to meet.

00:01:13.244 --> 00:01:15.557
On the weekends, loved ones enter the park

00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:19.633
and walk directly up to
the border, a steel fence.

00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:22.542
This gives families on both
sides a rare opportunity

00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:25.125
to see and speak to each other.

00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:37.384
- You know you're gonna see your mom,

00:01:37.384 --> 00:01:38.840
you're gonna see your family.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.757
But the fence only have tiny holes,

00:01:43.671 --> 00:01:48.448
and my mom sometimes put
the finger in the tiny hole.

00:01:48.448 --> 00:01:50.895
Just a little touch, it just touches.

00:01:50.895 --> 00:01:53.145
Or sometimes I give a kiss.

00:02:13.504 --> 00:02:15.910
- [Voiceover] On April 30th,
for the third time ever,

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.121
authorities agree to open the door,

00:02:18.121 --> 00:02:21.270
allowing such families a
brief moment to embrace.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:24.770
Each of them will only have three minutes.

00:02:36.396 --> 00:02:39.350
- Right now, I feel so
happy, because I'm waiting.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.017
I'm waiting so much this moment.

00:02:42.923 --> 00:02:44.325
- For the third time ever,

00:02:44.325 --> 00:02:48.242
we have the opportunity
to have this door open.

00:02:52.851 --> 00:02:57.009
(crowd cheering and clapping)

00:02:57.009 --> 00:03:00.176
(inspirational music)

00:03:02.728 --> 00:03:05.478
- (sighs) I feel

00:03:07.693 --> 00:03:08.610
incredible.

00:03:09.942 --> 00:03:11.359
She was so happy.

00:03:12.239 --> 00:03:14.301
She was so sweet with me.

00:03:14.301 --> 00:03:15.615
She tell me, "I love you."

00:03:15.615 --> 00:03:17.158
Mommy, I love you so much.

00:03:17.158 --> 00:03:19.075
I love you, I love you.

